Local Modifications:
Updated with tools/import.py cgl-rs (history replayed linearly); how far behind it is: `bun testing/acceptance.ts track`.
The crates (1) live in third_party/cgl-rs/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/cgl-rs/ unchanged.

